# Factory

Gather variant construction in one function. The UI must not know which class or adapter is created.

```ts
function createPaymentPort(provider: "zarinpal" | "idpay"): PaymentPort {
  if (provider === "zarinpal") return createZarinpalAdapter(zarinpalClient);
  return createIdpayAdapter(idpayClient);
}
```
